      "Explains Spark execution stages, tasks, partitions, and shuffle costs.",
      "Provides PySpark examples for partitioning, coalescing, caching, and checkpointing.",
      "Shows join tuning patterns for broadcast joins, bucket joins, and skew handling.",
      "Lists memory, compression, serialization, and file-size configuration options.",
      "Includes monitoring examples for query plans, task metrics, and partition skew."
